        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** singing | **Difficulty:** 3/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Expression transforms correct notes into communication — the difference between reciting and telling."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dynamics-and-colour",
      "title": "Dynamics and colour",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Soft verses, louder chorus — or inverse for surprise. Vowel colour shifts mood: bright 'ee' vs dark 'oh'."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rubato-in-folk",
      "title": "Rubato in folk",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Melody breathes within steady pulse — especially ballads and airs. Rhythm section holds tempo while singer flexes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "narrative-arc",
      "title": "Narrative arc",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Know who speaks, what happened, why it matters. First verse sets scene; final verse lands emotional point."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "variation",
      "title": "Variation",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Second time through: subtle dynamic or tempo shift, not random ornament. Serve the story."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
